WEBVTT

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.102
Hello, everybody.

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:22.606
My name is Tsumugi Shiraui.
It's nice to meet you.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.193
I look forward to getting
to know you all.

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:28.529
LIVE

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:30.697
It can't be!

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:33.200
What is the meaning of this?

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:35.452
Where is Kobayashi?!

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:36.995
UNABLE TO ACCESS

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:38.497
ACCESS DENIED, PERMISSION DENIED
ACCESS ADMINISTRATOR: KOBAYASHI

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:41.583
Damn her.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:47.547
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:56.848
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:00:57.641 --> 00:01:03.605
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:07.776
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:17.703
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.789
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:24.042
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:26.461
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:32.217
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:37.055
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:45.188
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:51.903
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:55.532
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:58.035
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:01.997
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:06.501
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:16.511
ABILITY

00:02:25.646 --> 00:02:29.066
<i>Thank you for waiting,
<i>Dr. Shinatose.</i></i>

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:32.069
<i>Please come in.</i>

00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:44.998
Kunato?

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:18.407
Kunato!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.659
What is the meaning of this?

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:23.495
It's exactly what it looks like.

00:03:23.578 --> 00:03:25.414
I created a hybrid.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:32.254
How could you? Surely you know
of the disaster a hundred years ago?

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.882
Yes. But as a scientist you should
be able to appreciate

00:03:35.966 --> 00:03:39.761
the significance of this research.

00:03:41.972 --> 00:03:44.808
How are you going to explain this
to the captain?

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:47.060
That's why I called for you,

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:49.020
Dr. Shinatose.

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:51.064
I require a larger facility

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:54.276
in order to complete my work.

00:03:54.359 --> 00:03:56.611
I wanted your help

00:03:56.695 --> 00:03:58.613
convincing the captain to cooperate.

00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:03.618
<i>She is a brilliant scientist.</i>

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:08.206
<i>I don't want to use the Sidonia Blood
<i>Nematode on her if I can avoid it.</i></i>

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.049
<i>The unidentified gauna's
<i>Heigus particle cannon</i></i>

00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:19.968
<i>made a direct hit on Gauna 549!</i>

00:04:20.051 --> 00:04:23.138
<i>Gauna 549,
<i>reporting 20 percent ena loss!</i></i>

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:24.097
GAUNA: UNIDENTIFIED

00:04:24.181 --> 00:04:25.015
<i>Ren, are you okay?!</i>

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:27.893
Yes, but what is that thing?!

00:04:28.393 --> 00:04:30.687
It seems like a gauna...

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:31.980
but...

00:04:40.155 --> 00:04:43.617
It seems the ena cannon we hastily
put together is coming apart.

00:04:43.867 --> 00:04:46.620
We'll have to destroy the enemy
a different way.

00:04:46.703 --> 00:04:48.789
You know what you have to do.

00:04:49.372 --> 00:04:51.500
Yes, Father.

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.295
It disappeared?!

00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:03.845
GAUNA 549 CORE LOCATION

00:05:03.929 --> 00:05:07.390
Gauna 549's ena is getting
whittled away towards its core!

00:05:07.808 --> 00:05:10.519
<i>Is a gauna attacking one of its own?</i>

00:05:21.947 --> 00:05:22.864
<i>Does it hurt?</i>

00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:27.994
<i>Remember it can hurt us.</i>

00:05:28.078 --> 00:05:30.372
<i>If it destroys our heart, we will die.</i>

00:05:30.539 --> 00:05:31.790
Yes!

00:05:37.879 --> 00:05:39.172
<i>Are you okay, Tanikaze?!</i>

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:40.215
Yes!

00:05:40.423 --> 00:05:42.092
Get away from there!

00:05:42.217 --> 00:05:44.719
We'll take them out
while they're fighting each other!

00:05:45.095 --> 00:05:46.596
I'm not missing when...

00:05:47.305 --> 00:05:49.224
-I'm this close!
<i>-Wait!</i>

00:06:02.946 --> 00:06:04.698
Father...

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:07.117
I'm sorry.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.374
GAUNA: ESTIMATED CORE LOCATION

00:06:14.457 --> 00:06:16.418
Tanikaze! What are you doing?!

00:06:16.501 --> 00:06:18.753
<i>This gauna isn't an enemy!</i>

00:06:18.837 --> 00:06:19.713
What?

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.518
Thank you,

00:06:33.602 --> 00:06:35.478
<i>whoever you are piloting the Tsugumori.</i>

00:06:35.562 --> 00:06:38.106
That voice... Hoshijiro?

00:06:38.189 --> 00:06:41.943
You don't seem to be
the Crimson Hawk Moth.

00:06:42.277 --> 00:06:44.029
No, I'm...

00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:46.573
<i>The ena surrounding
<i>the gauna's core is regenerating!</i></i>

00:06:46.865 --> 00:06:50.035
Garde squads!
Prioritize destroying the gauna's core!

00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:50.952
<i>Affirmative!</i>

00:06:51.661 --> 00:06:53.455
Rush the analysis on the new gauna!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.750
Judging from the Heigus interference wave
patterns, it's definitely a gauna!

00:06:57.292 --> 00:07:00.837
The resolution is still poor, but
we're getting an internal analysis now.

00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.047
LIFE FORM DETECTED

00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:05.467
A human life form has been detected
inside the new gauna!

00:07:06.593 --> 00:07:07.552
A human?!

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:11.014
All units, concentrate your shots
on the damaged area!

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:13.433
Surround the gauna and begin firing!

00:07:13.516 --> 00:07:14.601
<i>Copy that!</i>

00:07:31.201 --> 00:07:32.452
Wait, this is...

00:07:35.997 --> 00:07:36.831
Oh, no!

00:07:36.915 --> 00:07:39.125
Wait, everybody...

00:07:39.209 --> 00:07:40.377
watch out!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.797
<i>Gauna 549, sudden increase in
<i>internal Heigus particle concentration!</i></i>

00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:49.552
High concentration of Heigus particles
emitted from the gauna!

00:07:49.636 --> 00:07:52.430
It's a shockwave attack!
Unit 101 sustained heavy damage!

00:07:52.514 --> 00:07:55.767
Units 193 and 318, signal lost!

00:07:56.059 --> 00:07:57.310
No...

00:07:59.354 --> 00:08:03.441
<i>Fall back and get some distance first,
<i>Tanikaze! There could be a second attack!</i></i>

00:08:09.531 --> 00:08:14.953
Father, do I still need to hold back?

00:08:15.286 --> 00:08:16.913
This seems like a good opportunity.

00:08:17.414 --> 00:08:20.417
-Show me what you can do.
<i>-Be careful! Here comes another one!</i>

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.421
High Heigus particles detected from
the second gauna! Continuing to increase!

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:26.840
How could it generate this many particles

00:08:26.923 --> 00:08:28.133
at that size?

00:08:52.782 --> 00:08:56.453
Gauna 549,
disintegration confirmed.

00:08:56.911 --> 00:08:59.789
<i>Command, your orders for this gauna?</i>

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.294
There's no need to do anything.

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.336
Captain!

00:09:05.628 --> 00:09:07.630
That is not a gauna.

00:09:07.881 --> 00:09:10.300
It's one of Sidonia's new weapons.

00:09:11.134 --> 00:09:12.969
Kunato, explain.

00:09:14.763 --> 00:09:15.764
Kunato?

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.060
<i>The weapon which destroyed
<i>the enemy moments ago</i></i>

00:09:20.143 --> 00:09:21.978
<i>is no gauna.</i>

00:09:22.062 --> 00:09:23.605
<i>It is a hybrid specimen.</i>

00:09:27.609 --> 00:09:31.404
<i>It is a biological life form</i>

00:09:31.488 --> 00:09:33.656
<i>with a consciousness
<i>just like us human beings.</i></i>

00:09:34.115 --> 00:09:39.037
Kobayashi... She's recreated
Ochiai's lost research.

00:09:39.287 --> 00:09:41.623
It's time we question her sanity.

00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:45.293
She's spent too long in a live body.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:49.339
Her brain may be experiencing
gravity sickness.

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:53.676
We can't let her do as she pleases
any longer.

00:09:54.052 --> 00:09:56.179
She must be dealt with immediately.

00:09:56.429 --> 00:10:00.183
We will have to do something directly.

00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:03.812
Let us begin Kobayashi's
impeachment hearing.

00:10:08.483 --> 00:10:10.401
Grab hold of that there

00:10:10.485 --> 00:10:12.112
and bring it over. Good.

00:10:13.238 --> 00:10:14.781
Tanikaze!

00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:16.616
What happened to your right arm?

00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:20.120
Oh, I guess it happened in the battle.

00:10:20.745 --> 00:10:21.913
I'll be fine.

00:10:21.996 --> 00:10:23.498
It doesn't look fine.

00:10:23.832 --> 00:10:28.878
Anyway, I'm sorry I broke
the Tsugumori again, Tanba.

00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:33.466
You broke it fighting the gauna.
You're doing well.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:37.053
We'll always be here to fix up the gardes.
You don't need to worry about it.

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:41.474
Thank you very much.

00:10:41.558 --> 00:10:44.185
Just hurry up
and get yourself to Medical.

00:10:44.269 --> 00:10:45.228
Okay.

00:10:50.733 --> 00:10:52.569
<i>This is an announcement
<i>to all general citizens.</i></i>

00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:56.114
<i>Today at 1800, we will be holding
<i>a conference regarding the concerns</i></i>

00:10:56.281 --> 00:10:58.032
<i>surrounding the hybrid specimen.</i>

00:10:58.116 --> 00:11:01.161
So I tried putting corned beef
inside the rice balls,

00:11:01.411 --> 00:11:02.829
and it's really good.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.665
Yeah?

00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:11.129
<i>That hybrid sounded like Hoshijiro.</i>

00:11:11.379 --> 00:11:13.965
<i>Nagate should have noticed.</i>

00:11:14.048 --> 00:11:15.758
<i>Maybe he's been too pressured lately.</i>

00:11:15.842 --> 00:11:18.219
-Izana.
-What?

00:11:19.137 --> 00:11:21.931
That hybrid that called herself Tsumugi...

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:25.810
do you really think
it has human consciousness?

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.563
I'm not sure.

00:11:29.063 --> 00:11:31.608
If she really does,

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:34.527
I feel sorry for her.

00:11:34.736 --> 00:11:38.364
She was forced to face the gauna...

00:11:38.615 --> 00:11:41.034
as soon as she was born into this world.

00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:42.368
Nagate...

00:11:43.369 --> 00:11:44.913
Damn it.

00:11:50.126 --> 00:11:52.128
<i>I decided that</i>

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.672
<i>I wasn't backing down from anything.</i>

00:11:54.756 --> 00:11:57.884
<i>Not until I've destroyed every last gauna.</i>

00:12:14.525 --> 00:12:16.402
Transfer complete.

00:12:16.486 --> 00:12:19.489
All data from the Auxiliary Brain
has been retrieved.

00:12:20.406 --> 00:12:25.536
Are you sure you've extracted
the information from all layers?

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.039
You have my guarantee,
Captain Kobayashi.

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:32.335
You were able to do something
we couldn't do in a hundred years.

00:12:33.753 --> 00:12:35.004
Very impressive.

00:12:35.713 --> 00:12:40.802
Yes. Now we have all of
the scientist Ochiai's research,

00:12:40.885 --> 00:12:44.263
the man who came closest to the gauna
in all of Sidonian history.

00:12:44.347 --> 00:12:45.932
-Yure.
-Yes?

00:12:46.724 --> 00:12:50.603
You were there to witness
that disaster firsthand.

00:12:52.355 --> 00:12:53.189
NEURAL EXTRACTION COMPLETE

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:56.943
Ochiai's research
has benefited Sidonia greatly.

00:12:57.485 --> 00:12:58.945
But he is

00:12:59.028 --> 00:13:02.991
the very same person who brought Sidonia
to the brink of destruction.

00:13:03.533 --> 00:13:07.370
I'm restricting access
to all of Ochiai's research.

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:10.581
I'm the only one
who will be allowed direct access.

00:13:10.665 --> 00:13:11.624
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:13.459 --> 00:13:16.796
Good. Disconnect Ochiai
from the Auxiliary Brain.

00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:23.386
SITES OF SIDONIA EAST 4 RESIDENTIAL
DISTRICT ADMINISTRATOR'S QUARTERS

00:13:38.276 --> 00:13:40.028
I will now offer

00:13:40.111 --> 00:13:43.364
an explanation regarding
the hybrid specimen.

00:13:44.615 --> 00:13:47.994
As the name implies,
the hybrid specimen

00:13:48.327 --> 00:13:51.122
is a cross between human and gauna.

00:13:51.205 --> 00:13:52.582
In other words,

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:56.794
it is the ultimate life form
with a human mind

00:13:56.878 --> 00:13:58.963
and the gauna's strength.

00:13:59.922 --> 00:14:01.632
Now...

00:14:02.467 --> 00:14:04.969
let me formally introduce you.

00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:21.110
Thank you for taking the time
to come today.

00:14:21.819 --> 00:14:25.323
I am the hybrid Tsumugi Shiraui.

00:14:26.741 --> 00:14:28.701
I hope we can get to know each other,

00:14:28.785 --> 00:14:31.162
and I look forward to working together.

00:14:33.998 --> 00:14:36.626
Are there any assurances
it won't start eating people

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:40.546
or spew out contaminants like a gauna?!

00:14:41.631 --> 00:14:43.800
That will never happen.

00:14:44.092 --> 00:14:46.135
Her personality is flawless.

00:14:46.219 --> 00:14:49.806
You will never get
the generation who lived through

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:53.184
that catastrophe a hundred years ago
to accept it.

00:14:53.267 --> 00:14:57.063
Scientist Ochiai nearly destroyed
Sidonia with his monstrosity!

00:14:57.146 --> 00:14:59.524
The reason for his failure

00:14:59.607 --> 00:15:02.318
was inadequate control measures.

00:15:03.069 --> 00:15:07.365
These new hybrids
do not need to be piloted.

00:15:07.615 --> 00:15:10.701
You only need to give a simple order.

00:15:11.285 --> 00:15:13.579
Additionally, we are able to

00:15:13.663 --> 00:15:16.707
shut down the hybrids in an emergency.

00:15:16.791 --> 00:15:18.543
I'm not convinced.

00:15:18.626 --> 00:15:20.169
Excuse me.

00:15:20.294 --> 00:15:23.297
Yes, you. Go ahead.

00:15:24.006 --> 00:15:26.008
You're half gauna, aren't you?

00:15:26.426 --> 00:15:29.053
Did you have any reluctance
killing a gauna?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.472
I am not the same as the gauna,

00:15:31.556 --> 00:15:33.349
so there is no reluctance.

00:15:33.433 --> 00:15:37.437
-However, it was a little frightening.
-That's almost like a human response.

00:15:37.645 --> 00:15:40.106
She's well made.

00:15:40.189 --> 00:15:42.608
I need to apologize for shooting at her.

00:15:42.692 --> 00:15:46.612
The gauna destroyed
our home planet of Earth,

00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:51.075
and Sidonia may be
mankind's last ship.

00:15:51.701 --> 00:15:53.578
As a human being,

00:15:53.661 --> 00:15:56.414
I feel great anger towards the gauna.

00:15:56.664 --> 00:15:57.707
Mr. Tanikaze!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.127
Oh, my...

00:16:01.627 --> 00:16:03.713
What happened to your arm?

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:06.716
That isn't from protecting me, is it?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.803
Oh, don't worry, it's really nothing.

00:16:12.346 --> 00:16:14.182
Thank goodness!

00:16:14.265 --> 00:16:16.017
I'm glad to hear that!

00:16:25.151 --> 00:16:27.278
<i>Tsumugi! What are you doing?!</i>

00:16:28.237 --> 00:16:29.322
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:16:29.405 --> 00:16:31.240
I don't know about this.

00:16:32.116 --> 00:16:35.870
Father, I really, really want to
talk to Tanikaze!

00:16:35.953 --> 00:16:37.455
<i>You can't.</i>

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:39.832
<i>Continue with the speech we practiced.</i>

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:42.502
Yes.

00:16:45.213 --> 00:16:48.424
<i>She is still just a newborn child.</i>

00:16:48.508 --> 00:16:51.093
<i>She requires further instruction.</i>

00:16:51.886 --> 00:16:54.180
I am very terribly sorry
for the commotion.

00:16:54.639 --> 00:16:56.766
I promise to do everything in my power
to face the gauna

00:16:56.849 --> 00:17:00.269
and further ensure the survival
of the human race.

00:17:02.855 --> 00:17:06.609
Who the hell is gonna believe you?! You
almost just lost control in front of us!

00:17:06.692 --> 00:17:07.944
Get out of here!

00:17:08.027 --> 00:17:10.029
You're no different from the gauna!

00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:11.239
Get out, monster!

00:17:11.322 --> 00:17:13.491
You're a danger to humanity!

00:17:15.243 --> 00:17:16.619
Hey! Cut it out!

00:17:18.204 --> 00:17:21.666
Go away! Get out of here!

00:17:21.749 --> 00:17:23.543
Did you hear me!?

00:17:23.876 --> 00:17:27.213
I'd like to bring this meeting to a close.

00:17:27.505 --> 00:17:29.966
Thank you very much for your time.

00:17:43.646 --> 00:17:45.898
<i>Master Norio, you have visitors.</i>

00:17:47.441 --> 00:17:49.777
Let them through.

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:54.574
I don't think it was a good idea
to come without an appointment, Nagate.

00:17:54.907 --> 00:17:57.535
But we already pressed the doorbell.

00:17:57.618 --> 00:18:00.079
<i>Please come in.</i>

00:18:00.162 --> 00:18:03.583
Oh, yes. Thank you.

00:18:24.645 --> 00:18:26.355
What is that smell?

00:18:38.576 --> 00:18:41.996
Nagate, you shouldn't get too close.

00:18:53.883 --> 00:18:56.469
Tanikaze! What are you doing here?

00:18:57.803 --> 00:19:01.932
Oh, well. I came because I thought
you might be bored being alone.

00:19:05.227 --> 00:19:06.771
Really?!

00:19:06.854 --> 00:19:10.024
Wow, thank you so much!

00:19:13.736 --> 00:19:17.531
Who might this be?

00:19:18.157 --> 00:19:19.742
This is my friend Izana.

00:19:20.034 --> 00:19:21.869
We started out as cadets together.

00:19:23.579 --> 00:19:25.873
Hi, Izana! Nice to meet you!

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:29.251
Yeah. Nice to meet you too.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.045
I'm so happy!

00:19:31.128 --> 00:19:35.841
I was just thinking how
I'd like to learn more about humans!

00:19:35.925 --> 00:19:38.010
Oh, really?

00:19:38.094 --> 00:19:39.261
That's good.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.389
May I...

00:19:42.598 --> 00:19:45.059
May I touch you?

00:19:45.851 --> 00:19:47.687
Touch me?

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:50.314
Go ahead.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.401
Pardon me!

00:19:56.153 --> 00:19:58.781
Wait, what is this thing doing?!

00:19:58.864 --> 00:20:01.242
I want to accurately measure you to see

00:20:01.325 --> 00:20:03.661
what you're shaped like!

00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:10.668
Pardon me!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:23.806
So does that mean
you'll come see me again?!

00:20:24.014 --> 00:20:26.475
-Yeah.
-Thank you so much!

00:20:26.559 --> 00:20:28.602
I can't wait to see you again!

00:20:36.736 --> 00:20:39.321
Are you okay, Izana?

00:20:39.405 --> 00:20:42.700
That was... something.

00:20:42.992 --> 00:20:44.118
Yeah...

00:20:44.785 --> 00:20:47.788
but I'm glad we came.

00:20:48.038 --> 00:20:48.873
What?

00:20:55.379 --> 00:20:57.423
Tanikaze...

00:21:02.178 --> 00:21:06.015
IMPEACHMENT: AGREED

00:21:06.474 --> 00:21:10.478
That being the case, Kobayashi
has been formally impeached.

00:21:17.276 --> 00:21:20.821
As we agreed, I will take over
as the next representative.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.907
Are there any objections?

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.241
No objections.

00:21:24.325 --> 00:21:25.659
I object.

00:21:28.746 --> 00:21:31.123
Ochiai's clone.

00:21:31.207 --> 00:21:35.169
I am here representing Captain Kobayashi.

00:21:35.252 --> 00:21:36.921
How long have you been here?!

00:21:37.797 --> 00:21:40.049
From the beginning of the hearing.

00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:43.052
Did you all fail to notice?

00:21:43.469 --> 00:21:46.722
Perhaps your brains are all
experiencing gravity sickness.

00:21:47.389 --> 00:21:50.851
You were only kept alive because
you were the key to the Auxiliary Brain.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:53.687
There should be no use for you now.

00:21:54.313 --> 00:21:56.106
I don't understand why

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:59.235
Kobayashi has kept you alive.

00:22:00.611 --> 00:22:05.157
Or is there some other keyhole
that you are filling?

00:22:11.872 --> 00:22:13.165
What are you doing?!

00:22:24.677 --> 00:22:26.595
Wait, don't!

00:22:38.065 --> 00:22:40.401
An admirable job.

00:22:40.859 --> 00:22:42.361
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:50.828
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.911 --> 00:22:54.582
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.665 --> 00:22:59.753
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.338 --> 00:23:05.676
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.759 --> 00:23:09.346
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:15.352
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.436 --> 00:23:17.771
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.855 --> 00:23:19.857
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.943 --> 00:23:25.237
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.321 --> 00:23:27.156
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.239 --> 00:23:30.576
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.661
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.745 --> 00:23:36.373
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.457 --> 00:23:40.085
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.169 --> 00:23:43.797
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.881 --> 00:23:47.551
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.635 --> 00:23:51.221
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.305 --> 00:23:54.850
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.933 --> 00:23:59.271
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.355 --> 00:24:05.944
<i>As I walk this path</i>
